msgstr "Obnovljeno (nepopolno)"

msgid "Search Effort"
msgstr "Obseg Iskanja"

msgid "How many values are tried for the settings a device keeps no copy of. More effort finds settings in devices with many channels, but takes longer. Unlimited goes on until no value fits better; Stop ends the search."
msgstr "Koliko vrednosti se preizkusi za nastavitve, katerih kopije naprava ne hrani. Večji obseg najde nastavitve v napravah z veliko kanali, vendar traja dlje. Neomejeno išče, dokler nobena vrednost ne ustreza bolje; Ustavi konča iskanje."

msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Hitro"

msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Srednje"

msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Največ"

msgid "Search Again"
msgstr "Išči Znova"

msgid "Searches the settings of the selected incomplete devices again in what was read from them, with the chosen search effort. Needs no bus. A device already added to the project is replaced (one undo step)."
msgstr "Znova poišče nastavitve izbranih nepopolnih naprav v podatkih, prebranih iz njih, z izbranim obsegom iskanja. Ne potrebuje vodila. Naprava, ki je že dodana v projekt, se zamenja (en korak razveljavitve)."

msgid "Searching %(address)s again  (%(done)d/%(total)d)…"
msgstr "Ponovno iskanje za %(address)s  (%(done)d/%(total)d)…"

msgid "more search effort may help"
msgstr "večji obseg iskanja lahko pomaga"

msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Neomejeno"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "Rezultat"

msgid "Not read yet"
msgstr "Še ni prebrano"

msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Preverjeno"

